# Authentication

- [[login]]
- [[logging]] — the **auth** logging card, not the general one
- [[tokens]] — the **auth** tokens card, not the shared one

The last two are the spine rule earning its keep. Both names also exist nearer
the root, but a bare name is probed against this directory first, so a card
inside `specs/auth/` that writes `[[logging]]` gets the local variant without
having to qualify it. Reaching the general card takes an absolute link:
[[/logging]].
